  'Email us for further assistance': 'Send os en e-mail for mere hjælp',
  'Before contacting us, please have your account email, inquiry topic (registration, payment, technical), and any relevant screenshots ready. Providing detailed info helps us resolve your issue quicker and reduces back-and-forth.': 'Før du skriver, så hav konto-e-mail, emne (registrering, betaling, teknisk) og eventuelle skærmbilleder klar. Jo tydeligere detaljer, desto hurtigere løsning.',
